Package: sextant
Title: Parameter Provenance and Elicitation for Gyro Scenarios
Version: 0.0.0.9003
Authors@R: 
    person("Andre", "Bonfrer", email = "abonfrer@me.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A companion to the Gyro customer-equity budgeting tool. Gyro
    prices managerial judgements; sextant records where those judgements
    come from. It reads and writes Gyro scenario files (schema v2),
    attaches provenance annotations per parameter (source, rationale,
    location), measures annotation coverage with attention to high-stakes
    judgements, and produces a provenance report for budget meetings. It
    performs no equity computation.
